/n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那样的；那种；像那样的；不可能！；才不会！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201543\">どうしてそんなことが<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こったの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How did such a thing come about?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">そんなに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那么多；那样；像那样</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202116\">でも、そんなに<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くはなかったよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Well, it wasn&#x27;t all that bad.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ソース</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">信息来源；信息源；源代码</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぞい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">沿着；沿；靠着（河流、海岸、铁路等）；在（街道等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141136\"><ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>海岸<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>沿<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>航行<rp>(</rp><rt>こうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The ship sailed along the coast.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\">